/ActualText (User Experience Designer with a background that spans accounting, graphic design and UX, and a genuine belief that the best digital products come from understanding people first. That winding path was not accidental. Each step sharpened a different part of how I think, analytically, visually and with empathy at the centre. Naturally curious, I like to ask why before I ask how, and I work well within cross-functional teams while holding my own independently.)
